          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.10.010:block:1",
          "start": 731
        },
        "quote": "(b) Any person legally entitled to apply for and receive a permit under this chapter shall make application by calling the administrative authority. Such person shall give a description of the character of the work proposed to be done and the address. The administrative authority may require plans, specifications or drawings and such information as deemed necessary. (Code 1981 § 10-40.2. Code 1995 § 26-51.)",
